<title>USA: United Park City sets terms of offering.</title>
<headline>United Park City sets terms of offering.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Park City Mines Co on Tuesday fixed a subscription price of $16.00 per share for a rights offering announced in June.</p>
<p>The company said it would raise roughly $5.4 million by offering 340,000 shares of its common stock to existing shareholders under the plan.</p>
<p>Originally, United Park said it planned to raise $6 million through the rights offering, money it said would be used to repay debt, fund operations and finance real estate development.</p>
